    "turn_text": "And, and I don't know where that line is. And I, I have a generally libertarian attitude about about knowledge and what people believe and that this stuff can work itself out at that time. And I sort of believe that there's a getting at truth that we get to when people are sort of free to pursue the craziest theories that they want.",
