    "turn_idx": 250,
    "turn_text": "But when I did that same sex wedding, I officiated it. I think I made a big mistake in the political world, and that's in a radio interview. I said, if they want to come after this libertarian, this guy who's liberty minded, they can pack a lunch. and they certainly took that seriously and I will tell you this I was sitting with my wife Christine who you know well and one of the most amazing women in my life and everything and we're sitting there she goes honey you know this you're done I mean if you do this wedding It's okay, baby. I support you, but you're done politically.\" And I said, it's okay. I said, you know, if I'm done politically because I officiate a same-sex wedding between two people who love each other, then so be it. And I want to make this confession now. I didn't really believe it.",
